r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\">NEW course for 2026-27: for new RE leads and those who would like a refresher (cross-phase). This course takes place over three sessions which will introduce the key aspects of RE subject leadership.\r\n We will cover the statutory requirements and key documents to be aware of, RE curriculum development, how to support colleagues’ ongoing CPD and next steps for developing further as a subject leader. Key aspects of RE leadership in a Church school, including\r\n the SIAMS framework will also be addressed.</p>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDelegates will be charged £50+VAT for the 3 sessions across the academic year.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div class=\"me-email-text\" lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"max-width:1024px; color:#242424; font-family:'Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px; overflow:hidden; white-space:nowrap\">\r\n________________________________________________________________________________</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:12px\"><span class=\"me-email-text\" style=\"font-size:20px; color:#242424; font-weight:600\">Microsoft Teams meeting</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><span class=\"me-email-text\" style=\"font-size:20px; color:#242424; font-weight:600\">Join:\r\n</span><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/347755432876363?p=eNbqvo1PLYou8jNA7y\" id=\"meet_invite_block.action.join_link\" title=\"Meeting join\" aria-label=\"Meeting join\" class=\"me-email-link\" style=\"font-size:20px; text-decoration:underline; color:#5B5FC7\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/347755432876363?p=eNbqvo1PLYou8j